.TH tkeditor n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkeditor \- simple text editor
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkeditor
.br
set w [::tkutils::tkeditor::widget .w]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Editable text widget with file load/save, modified tracking, an extensible
right-click edit menu, search and replace (find, findAll, findNext with wrap,
replace/replace-all, match highlighting), go-to-line / cursor position, and an
optional read-only mode. File I/O uses the tclutils common helpers. See
docs/tkeditor.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tclutils(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, editor
